cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it and the related article below."
type: dataset
title: "Vibration measurements with observer-declared variance change points"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Nine smartphone motion-sensor recordings (G-Force Meter, gyroscope, and
  linear accelerometer) of a person, a motorbike, and a car. Variance changes
  are induced by gait changes or by a change of road surface (cobblestone
  versus asphalt). Observer-declared time intervals for structural breaks are
  included. The recordings are those analysed in Witulska and Wyłomańska
  (2022), Mathematica Applicanda 50(1), 65–106.
authors:
