      Wrocław University of Science and Technology, Wybrzeże Wyspiańskiego 27,
      50-370 Wrocław, Poland
keywords:
  - change-point detection
  - variance change
  - structural break
  - vibration
  - smartphone sensors
  - accelerometer
  - gyroscope
  - G-Force Meter
  - Physics Toolbox Sensor Suite
  - walking
  - running
  - motorbike
  - car
  - road surface
